00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:37.920
at the distribution of all patterns that could&nbsp;
occur from that more restricted set of words.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:43.840
You search through all 13,000 possibilities,&nbsp;
and you find the one that maximizes that entropy

